     as permissive as the mode with which the file descriptor _f_d or the ELF
     descriptor _e_l_f was created with.  Legal values for argument _m_o_d_e are:

     DW_DLC_RDWR   Permit reading and writing of DWARF information.
     DW_DLC_READ   Operate in read-only mode.
